<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Assore interim shr falls, div decreased.</title>
<headline>Assore interim shr falls, div decreased.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     1,693.0	 vs     2,700.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		   200.0	 vs     250.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	     23.70	 vs     37.80</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     11.49	 vs     10.86</p>
<p>    Tax			    4.15	 vs     4.08</p>
<p>Equity accounted</p>
<p>    earnings		    17.41	 vs     31.69</p>
<p>    Turnover		    11.30	 vs     10.68</p>
<p>Div payable April 14</p>
<p>on register March 14</p>
<p>Full name: The Associated Ore and Metal Corporation Ltd (mining)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said the decrease in earnings was caused by the substantial decrease in equity accounted earnings of associate company The Associated Manganese Mines of South Africa Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
